Subject: [PATCH 04/10] =?UTF-8?q?BlueOS:=20Launcher3:=200.7.2=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20transparency=20for=20every=20material,=20icon=20plate=20tran?=
 =?UTF-8?q?sparency,=20Plana,=20Arona=20at=20her=20desk?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The transparency slider now works for glass / outline / accent too (was fixed at 55/45 %), solid stays opaque.
Icon plates: their own transparency; the icon theme reloads when it changes. Arona widget: Arona or Plana
(her name, her phrases); left alone 90 s, Arona sits down on her desk (the game's work page, the desk in the
palette's colours) and swings her legs, asleep at it at night; a tap and she stands up.

Change-Id: Ib6faafd0852fe35f7b6184b6b76de0be50a42ff0
